<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px;">
    <h2 style="color: #e74c3c;">Account Locked</h2>
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>Your {{appName}} account has been locked due to too many failed login attempts.</p>
    <p>For your security, your account will be temporarily locked for 30 minutes. After that, you can try logging in again.</p>
    <p>If this wasn't you, your account may be under attack. We recommend:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Changing your password immediately</li>
      <li>Enabling Two-Factor Authentication</li>
      <li>Contacting our support team</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="{{supportUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #3498db; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 10px 0;">Contact Support</a>
    <p>Best regards,<br>The {{appName}} Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>